# Benchmark sources and reference interpreters for the Scheme example.
# fetch.sh clones r7rs-benchmarks into bench/scheme/r7rs-benchmarks/;
# install.sh builds chibi-scheme into bench/scheme/install/. Both are
# gitignored: nothing from these projects is committed, only this manifest,
# the scripts, and our own prelude/postlude/inputs for the harness.
#
# r7rs-benchmarks: Larceny's R7RS benchmarks (W. D. Clinger et al., drawn
# from the Gabriel, Kernighan-Van Wyk and Gambit suites) as maintained by
# ecraven. License: the repository has no LICENSE file (GitHub reports
# none) and the program headers carry no license statement, so no license
# is granted for the collection. We therefore only download it at bench
# time and never commit or redistribute any of it.
#
# chibi-scheme: BSD-3-Clause (COPYING in its tree). Release 0.12.
#
